><p id="prGrading" class="tiny"></p><div id="prLedger"></div><button type="button" id="prMore">Show more</button></article><details class="pr-method"><summary>How this record is counted</summary><p>For each completed game, we use the latest saved main-model forecast generated before kickoff. Rebuilt historical tests are excluded. Older recovered forecast files are labeled in each receipt; their original publication time was not independently verified.</p><p>A moneyline pick selects the team with the higher predicted score. Spread picks compare the predicted margin with the saved point spread. Over/under picks compare the predicted combined score with the saved total. An exact model tie is no pick. Missing lines are excluded, never counted as wins.</p><p>Only a saved pregame line can define the spread, total or underdog. Quotes can have a different timestamp from the forecast; open a receipt to check both. No archived moneyline prices are available for these older games, so we do not claim payouts or profit.</p><p>Conference filters include a game if either team belongs to that conference; cross-conference games can appear in both groups. The cards and receipts share the same filters. Explanations use the saved main-model inputs. Final game stats are shown separately and cannot prove why a pick worked.</p><a href="daily-results.json" download>Download all graded picks</a></details>`;
