lank" rel="noreferrer">Official report ↗</a>`:''}`).join('')}<ul>${(research.missing||[]).map(s=>`<li>${esc(s)}</li>`).join('')}</ul></details><details><summary>Source games and limits</summary><p>${esc(research.limit)}</p><p>${esc(home)}: ${research.profiles?.home?.games??0} source games. ${esc(away)}: ${research.profiles?.away?.games??0} source games. Regulation plays only. Missing games are excluded, not treated as zero.</p><ul>${sources.map(s=>`<li>${/^https:\/\//.test(s.sourceUrl||'')?`<a href="${esc(s.sourceUrl)}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">${esc(s.date.slice(0,10))} · game ${esc(s.id)}</a>`:esc(s.id)} · retrieved ${esc(s.observedAt)}</li>`).join('')}</ul></details></section>`;
  }
